---
title: Implemented product knowledge and evaluated source boundary
---
%%{init: {"theme":"base","themeVariables":{"fontFamily":"Arial, sans-serif","fontSize":"16px","primaryTextColor":"#14263d","lineColor":"#53677f","edgeLabelBackground":"#ffffff"},"flowchart":{"curve":"basis","nodeSpacing":30,"rankSpacing":40},"themeCSS":".nodeLabel, .edgeLabel, .cluster-label, .flowchartTitleText { font-family: Arial, sans-serif !important; }"}}%%
flowchart TB
    USER["Human or delegated agent<br/>Authenticated project authority"]:::client
    MCP["Go MCP gateway<br/>Role, purpose and field checks · audit"]:::service
    PROPOSAL["Product / BRS / feature / intent proposal<br/>Immutable pending version"]:::pending
    GATE["Exact-digest QA evidence<br/>Explicit human Product Owner decision"]:::gate
    SOURCE["Operator-configured HTTP source views<br/>Log · metric · event · lake · audit<br/>Native system bridges are external"]:::external
    VALIDATE["Validate schema, fields and bounds<br/>Window · watermark · offsets / snapshot"]:::gate
    RECEIPT["Immutable collection receipt<br/>Complete / partial / failed<br/>Actor · role · owner · query digest"]:::data
    PG["PostgreSQL authority<br/>Accepted product heads and relationships<br/>Eligible time-scoped observations"]:::data
    INDEX["Local Ollama embedding worker<br/>Verified Milvus read-back · AGE projection"]:::service
    CONTEXT["Product context<br/>Semantic candidates + PostgreSQL structure<br/>Hydrate current versions and recheck source access"]:::service
    INTENT["Accepted intent context<br/>Exact BRS and criterion bindings<br/>Uncertainty or stale requirements block readiness"]:::gate
    EVAL["Deterministic observation reconciliation<br/>Satisfied / violated / inconclusive<br/>Immutable evidence; no inferred root cause"]:::service
    NEXT["Remaining execution boundary<br/>Agent supervisor · delivery · remediation<br/>Separate effect authority and verification"]:::external
    USER --> MCP
    MCP --> PROPOSAL --> GATE --> PG
    MCP -->|Bounded reads| SOURCE --> VALIDATE
    VALIDATE --> RECEIPT
    VALIDATE -->|Eligible observations| PG
    PG --> INDEX --> CONTEXT
    PG --> CONTEXT --> MCP
    PG --> INTENT --> EVAL
    RECEIPT --> EVAL
    EVAL -->|Retained result and audit| PG
    INTENT -.-> NEXT
    EVAL -.-> NEXT
